2026-10-24T00:27:02.2854236Z Linux USB/IP device management (experimental preview)
2026-10-24T00:27:02.2854700Z 
2026-10-24T00:27:02.2855217Z Usage: rustusb [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>
2026-10-24T00:27:02.2855423Z 
2026-10-24T00:27:02.2855515Z Commands:
2026-10-24T00:27:02.2855819Z   agent               Run or query the nonroot shared application service using fixed profiles
2026-10-24T00:27:02.2856388Z   secure-server       Serve configured devices with mandatory mutual TLS and per-device authorization
2026-10-24T00:27:02.2857085Z   secure-discover     Read the stable-key device catalog over the configured mutually authenticated TLS endpoint
2026-10-24T00:27:02.2857754Z   secure-attach       Import the configured stable device key and own its encrypted VHCI relay until stopped
2026-10-24T00:27:02.2858432Z   native-pending      Inspect unresolved secure Native channels through the root helper (root only)
2026-10-24T00:27:02.2859041Z   native-reconcile    Verify a stopped Native channel and retire its record (root only; no USB writes)
2026-10-24T00:27:02.2859636Z   physical-pending    Inspect unresolved physical grants through the root helper (root only)
2026-10-24T00:27:02.2860251Z   physical-reconcile  Verify restored physical state and retire its grant record (root only; no USB writes)
2026-10-24T00:27:02.2860931Z   physical-server     Serve explicitly authorized whole USB devices through Linux USBFS (experimental, no TLS)
2026-10-24T00:27:02.2861599Z   virtual-server      Serve two virtual test devices; this experimental mode provides no authentication or TLS
2026-10-24T00:27:02.2862244Z   devices             Scan local devices without changing drivers. Discovery is not compatibility validation
2026-10-24T00:27:02.2862821Z   doctor              Read installed tool, module and helper capabilities without loading modules
2026-10-24T00:27:02.2863595Z   discover            Query a server's USB/IP device list over an administrator-managed trusted network
2026-10-24T00:27:02.2864193Z   export              Export an administrator-allowlisted device fingerprint via the privileged helper
2026-10-24T00:27:02.2864744Z   unexport            Release an allowlisted export and request local driver reattachment
2026-10-24T00:27:02.2865240Z   attach              Import a remote bus ID through an allowlisted endpoint and Linux VHCI
2026-10-24T00:27:02.2865684Z   detach              Disconnect an authorized local VHCI port (0..255)
2026-10-24T00:27:02.2866117Z   sessions            Read authoritative native kernel session state through the helper
2026-10-24T00:27:02.2866514Z   status              Query helper and kernel status
2026-10-24T00:27:02.2866867Z   help                Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
2026-10-24T00:27:02.2867123Z 
2026-10-24T00:27:02.2867187Z Options:
2026-10-24T00:27:02.2867451Z       --json               Emit machine-readable JSON to stdout; logs remain on stderr
2026-10-24T00:27:02.2867975Z       --socket <SOCKET>    Root-owned local helper socket [default: /run/rustusb/control.sock]
2026-10-24T00:27:02.2868518Z       --timeout <TIMEOUT>  Discovery timeout covering DNS, connect and response [default: 10]
2026-10-24T00:27:02.2868952Z       --log-json           Emit JSON tracing logs on stderr
2026-10-24T00:27:02.2869521Z   -h, --help               Print help
2026-10-24T00:27:02.2869757Z   -V, --version            Print version
